      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YANKEE RAIN (6) led last start and scored in a far better performance at Terang over 2180m, getting home by 4.5 metres. Stepping up a level this time but she is capable of making it two on end. MONSIEUR FLAMEL (7) is going about his business in good style with placings at his last four starts including a second most recently over 2180m at Kilmore, beaten 1.2 metres after settling at the rear of the field. Must overcome a very wide draw. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role again. TORQUE IN HEAVEN (9) is in the mix following a respectable second at his most recent appearance over 2180m at Terang. MEGAWATTS (5) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at Charlton over 2100m.",
